.TH "Pbmtobrush User Manual" 0 "27 June 2026" "netpbm documentation"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
pbmtobrush \- convert a PBM image to a doodle brush file

.UN synopsis
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBpbmtobrush\fP
[\fIpbmfile\fP]

.UN description
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This program is part of
.BR "Netpbm" (1)\c
\&.
.PP
\fBpbmtobrush\fP reads a PBM image as input and produces a Xerox doodle
brush file as output.

  
.UN options
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
There are no command line options defined specifically
for \fBpbmtobrush\fP, but it recognizes the options common to all
programs based on libnetpbm (See 
.UR index.html#commonoptions
 Common Options
.UE
\&.)

.UN seealso
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR "pbm" (1)\c
\&
.BR "pbm" (1)\c
\&


.UN history
.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
.PP
\fBpbmtobrush\fP was new in Netpbm 11.15 (June 2026).  Scott Pakin wrote
it just to have something to exercise \fBbrushtopbm\fP, which had been in
Netpbm since the very beginning.
.PP
By this time, the Xerox doodle brush file format was already obsolete;
Scott could not find any examples of it in web search.  Scott
reverse-engineered the format from \fBbrushtopbm\fP.
  

.UN author
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"

Written by Scott Pakin in June 2026.
